# spec/subgraph-vectors/MANIFEST.sha256 — subgraph snapshot hash conformance vector set
#
# Per-file hash = SHA-256(file bytes).
# set_sha256 = SHA-256 over the "<hex>  <name>" lines below, sorted by file name, each
#              terminated by LF. Comment lines and the set_sha256 line are not inputs.
#
# This set is a different plane from the canon serialization set (spec/vectors/canon)
# and from the Merkle set (spec/merkle-vectors): those fix how bytes are written and
# how the log is folded; this one fixes how the world slice a token was issued
# against is encoded, selected, and hashed. Separate manifests because they are
# revised for unrelated reasons.
#
# Generated by cmd/gensubgraphvec (internal). The independent checker is
# spec/tools/spec_subgraph_check.py.
